// The SvelteKit demo app, copied verbatim from what `sv create` writes for its "demo" template (the `sv`
// package, dist/templates/demo; MIT licensed): a styled home page with a counter, an About page and the
// Sverdle word game with its form actions. Generated, not hand-written: re-run `sv create <name> --template
// demo --types ts --no-add-ons --no-install` and regenerate rather than editing by hand.
//
// The one change: the home page used `svelte-welcome.png` as the <img> fallback inside a <picture> whose
// <source> is the .webp. The PNG is 360 KB for a browser that cannot show WebP, so the <img> uses the .webp
// too and the PNG is left out. Kept apart from fullstackRecipes.ts and loaded on demand (this is ~300 KB).

